# a sales thread gets a drafted reply
call_tool watch Gmail:search_threads
think intent classify
think draft write
ask gate
call_tool send Gmail:reply
say recap
done

# a scheduling thread checks the calendar
call_tool watch Gmail:search_threads
think intent classify
call_tool slots Google_Calendar:list_events
say recap
done

# anything else is labelled for a human
call_tool watch Gmail:search_threads
think intent classify
call_tool label Gmail:label_thread
say recap
done

# rejecting the gate stops before sending
call_tool watch Gmail:search_threads
think intent classify
think draft write
ask gate
done

# an empty inbox still finishes
call_tool watch Gmail:search_threads
say recap
done
